{"version":1,"content":"<p>《北京日報》報道，截至2025年底，北京60歲及以上常住人口達528.8萬人，佔常住人口24.3%，預計到2035年北京將進入重度老齡化社會，老年人口佔比將逾33%，即每3個人有1個是老年人。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T04:19:08.310891+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T02:38:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:42.843608+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T04:17:34.309041+00:00","content_hash":"3517f480ca9f2a544aa510616ea1aeabe53e94f79919f51fcb42fa1a2ffaf4d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}